{"ID":"20260916173906-xqq97e8","Spec":"3","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-xqq97e8","title":"LeetCode 4. 寻找两个正序数组的中位数","type":"doc","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-krvags9","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-krvags9","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260916173906-wb6fkjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-wb6fkjk","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"难度：Hard　标签：数组、二分查找、分治　链接：https://leetcode.cn/problems/median-of-two-sorted-arrays/"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-tydnizc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-tydnizc","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"题目"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-z8ma5lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-z8ma5lr","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给你两个已经"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"从小到大排好序"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的数组 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（长 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"m"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）和 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（长 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​），求这两个数组合并以后的中位数。"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-5ocfjf4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-5ocfjf4","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-yd436fl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-yd436fl","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-14u8qa3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-14u8qa3","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"奇数个取正中间那个，偶数个取中间两个求平均（所以返回值是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"double"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-hk9ns4l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-hk9ns4l","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-8br79pj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-8br79pj","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0 \u0026lt;= m, n \u0026lt;= 1000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1 \u0026lt;= m + n \u0026lt;= 2000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ —— 也就是说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"允许其中一个是空数组"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-yn0a8dk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-yn0a8dk","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-dn6sfuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-dn6sfuz","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元素范围 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-10^6 \u0026lt;= nums1[i], nums2[i] \u0026lt;= 10^6"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-3xf91y7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-3xf91y7","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-xk4350q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-xk4350q","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"题面还额外加了一句：时间复杂度必须是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(log (m+n))"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，这句才是本题被评为 Hard 的原因"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-vumhkrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-vumhkrh","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"示例 1：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums1 = [1,3]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums2 = [2]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"2.00000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（合并 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[1,2,3]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，中间是 2）\n示例 2：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums1 = [1,2]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums2 = [3,4]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"2.50000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（合并 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[1,2,3,4]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(2+3)/2 = 2.5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-1kb9ls4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-1kb9ls4","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"思路"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-u8yrfer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-u8yrfer","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一反应：这题有什么难的？两个有序数组，归并排序我最熟了，直接合并成一个大数组，再按下标取中间不就完了？——这就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解法一"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，五分钟写完，样例全过，一提交也 AC 了。"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-ndvmsvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-ndvmsvr","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可是抬头一看题目要求 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(log(m+n))"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​……我这个是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(m+n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，还多开了 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(m+n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的空间，属于「能过但没做题」。这题之所以挂 Hard，考的根本不是「怎么求中位数」，而是「"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不合并"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么把中位数找出来」。"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-p94x40j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-p94x40j","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二反应：不开数组了，搞两个指针在各自的数组上滑，谁小谁往前走一步，数到第 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(m+n)/2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 个就停。——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解法二"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，空间压到了 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，可时间还是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(m+n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，复杂度仍然没达标。"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-xkqw7e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-xkqw7e6","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真正的正解（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解法三"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）是「中位数」换个说法：如果我能把两个数组切一刀，让"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"左半部分一共正好"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"half = (m+n+1)/2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"个数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，并且"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"左边的最大值 ≤ 右边的最小值"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那这一刀就是正确的划分——奇数个时左边最大那个就是中位数，偶数个时 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(左边最大 + 右边最小) / 2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就是了。"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-y0hfpbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-y0hfpbp","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这一刀怎么找？设从 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 里切 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 个放左边，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 里就得切 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"j = half - i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 个。​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 越大 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"j"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就越小，而两个数组本身是有序的，所以「找合适的 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​」这件事可以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"直接二分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！而且只要在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"短的那个"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数组上二分，复杂度就是题目要的 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(log(min(m,n)))"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-zubfbbr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-zubfbbr","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-ee717ji","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-ee717ji","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-yiogs0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-yiogs0h","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点 1：进函数先把 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 换个位置，保证 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是短的。这既是复杂度的保证，也是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"j = half - i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 不会越界的前提。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-66m984l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-66m984l","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-lpwy3or","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-lpwy3or","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点 2：四个边界值（​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"i==0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"i==m"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"j==0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"j==n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）全用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"±∞"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 兜住，空数组和切到头这些极端情况就不用写一堆 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"if"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 特判了。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-c2w9b76","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-c2w9b76","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-392ii8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-392ii8x","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点 3：判断标准就两条：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums1[i-1] \u0026lt;= nums2[j]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 且 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums2[j-1] \u0026lt;= nums1[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​；不满足就看是哪边太大，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 往左收还是往右扩。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-3pa11y7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-3pa11y7","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-lwuwup0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-lwuwup0","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复杂度：解法一 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(m+n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 时间 + ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(m+n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 空间；解法二 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(m+n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 时间 + ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 空间；解法三 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(log(min(m,n)))"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 时间 + ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 空间。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-1dcqg6e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-1dcqg6e","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码（C）"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-u60hc9i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-u60hc9i","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法一：归并成一个大数组再取中间（好想，但不符合要求）"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-n2lsx5q","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-n2lsx5q","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// LeetCode 4 寻找两个正序数组的中位数\n// 一开始就是这么写的：两个有序数组，归并一下不就完事了，爽！\n// 缺点：O(m+n) 时间、O(m+n) 空间。题目要 O(log(m+n))，这就被打脸了。\n// 部分正确（能 AC 但复杂度不达标），问过 AI：我干的是「合并」，不是「划分」。\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n\ndouble findMedianSortedArrays(int* nums1, int nums1Size, int* nums2, int nums2Size) {\n    int total = nums1Size + nums2Size;\n    // 开一个装得下所有人的桶\n    int *merged = (int *)malloc(total * sizeof(int));\n    int i = 0, j = 0, k = 0;\n\n    // 归并的老套路：谁小谁先出队\n    while (i \u003c nums1Size \u0026\u0026 j \u003c nums2Size) {\n        if (nums1[i] \u003c= nums2[j]) merged[k++] = nums1[i++];\n        else                      merged[k++] = nums2[j++];\n    }\n    // 剩下的直接搬过来\n    while (i \u003c nums1Size) merged[k++] = nums1[i++];\n    while (j \u003c nums2Size) merged[k++] = nums2[j++];\n\n    double ans;\n    if (total % 2 == 1) {\n        ans = merged[total / 2];                 // 奇数：正中间那个\n    } else {\n        // 偶数：中间两个求平均。一定要写 2.0！写成 /2 就是整数除法，\n        // 2.5 会被截成 2.0，这个坑以前在 PAT 里踩过\n        ans = (merged[total / 2 - 1] + merged[total / 2]) / 2.0;\n    }\n    free(merged);                                // 自己 malloc 的，自己还回去\n    return ans;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-aliiczc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-aliiczc","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法二：双指针数到中间（不开数组，O(m+n) 时间 / O(1) 空间）"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-154nf7r","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-154nf7r","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 不想开数组了，那就两个指针各自滑：谁小谁前进一步，\n// 数到第 midL、midR 个就记下来——中位数只跟这一两个位置有关\ndouble findMedianSortedArrays(int* nums1, int nums1Size, int* nums2, int nums2Size) {\n    int total = nums1Size + nums2Size;\n    // 这样取下标有个好处：奇数时 midL == midR，就不用分奇偶写两套了\n    int midL = (total - 1) / 2;\n    int midR = total / 2;\n    int i = 0, j = 0, cnt = 0;\n    int left = 0, right = 0;\n\n    while (cnt \u003c= midR) {\n        int cur;\n        // 越界判断必须写在前面！短路求值是从左往右算的，\n        // 要是把 nums1[i] \u003c= nums2[j] 提到前面，某个数组走空后就先越界读了\n        if (i \u003c nums1Size \u0026\u0026 (j \u003e= nums2Size || nums1[i] \u003c= nums2[j])) cur = nums1[i++];\n        else                                                           cur = nums2[j++];\n\n        if (cnt == midL) left  = cur;\n        if (cnt == midR) right = cur;\n        cnt++;\n    }\n    return (left + right) / 2.0;   // 又是 2.0，别再写成 2 了\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-1j9hn6l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-1j9hn6l","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法三：二分划分（O(log(min(m,n)))，正解）"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-qoypus7","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-qoypus7","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 正解：不合并，而是「切一刀」。\n// 目标：左边一共 half = (m+n+1)/2 个数，且 左边最大 \u003c= 右边最小。\n// 从 nums1 取 i 个到左边，nums2 就得取 j = half - i 个，于是「找 i」可以二分。\n// 先让 nums1 是短的那个数组：i 的搜索范围小，而且 j 绝不会越界。\n#define INF  (1 \u003c\u003c 30)      // 当 +∞ 用的哨兵，比元素上限 1e6 大得多就够\n#define NEG  (-(1 \u003c\u003c 30))   // 故意不用 INT_MIN/INT_MAX：不用管 limits.h，也躲开字面量的坑\n\ndouble findMedianSortedArrays(int* nums1, int nums1Size, int* nums2, int nums2Size) {\n    // 保证 nums1 更短：二分用在短数组上，复杂度才是 log(min(m,n))。\n    // C 里没有现成的 swap，但交换「地址 + 长度」最省事的办法就是递归调用自己\n    if (nums1Size \u003e nums2Size)\n        return findMedianSortedArrays(nums2, nums2Size, nums1, nums1Size);\n\n    int m = nums1Size, n = nums2Size;\n    int total = m + n;\n    int half = (total + 1) / 2;   // 左半边要装的个数：+1 是为了奇数时左边多一个，直接取左边最大就完事\n\n    int lo = 0, hi = m;           // i 的范围：从 nums1 里取几个放左边\n    while (lo \u003c= hi) {\n        int i = (lo + hi) / 2;    // nums1 贡献 i 个\n        int j = half - i;         // nums2 就得贡献 j 个（因为 m \u003c= n，0 \u003c= j \u003c= n 恒成立）\n\n        // 四个边界值：切到头了就用 ±∞ 顶上，省掉特判空数组/切在边上的 if\n        int inLeft  = (i \u003e 0) ? nums1[i - 1] : NEG;   // nums1 左半的最大\n        int inRight = (i \u003c m) ? nums1[i]     : INF;   // nums1 右半的最小\n        int jnLeft  = (j \u003e 0) ? nums2[j - 1] : NEG;   // nums2 左半的最大\n        int jnRight = (j \u003c n) ? nums2[j]     : INF;   // nums2 右半的最小\n\n        if (inLeft \u003c= jnRight \u0026\u0026 jnLeft \u003c= inRight) {\n            // 这一刀切对了！\n            if (total % 2 == 1) {                     // 奇数：左边最大的那个就是中位数\n                return inLeft \u003e jnLeft ? inLeft : jnLeft;\n            }\n            int leftMax  = inLeft \u003e jnLeft ? inLeft : jnLeft;\n            int rightMin = inRight \u003c jnRight ? inRight : jnRight;\n            return (leftMax + rightMin) / 2.0;        // 偶数：中间两个求平均\n        } else if (inLeft \u003e jnRight) {\n            hi = i - 1;   // nums1 左边给的太大了，i 往左收\n        } else {\n            lo = i + 1;   // nums2 左边给的太大了（等价于 nums1 给少了），i 往右扩\n        }\n    }\n    return 0.0;   // 题目保证输入合法，理论上走不到这\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-eqg9qti","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-eqg9qti","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本地想自己跑一下"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-9rkoqjh","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-9rkoqjh","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 本地调试用的 main，力扣提交时不需要这段\n// 下面贴的是解法三；想试解法二就把函数替换掉、名字保持一样即可\n#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n\n#define INF  (1 \u003c\u003c 30)\n#define NEG  (-(1 \u003c\u003c 30))\n\n/* ==================== 解答函数（和解法三一样） ==================== */\ndouble findMedianSortedArrays(int* nums1, int nums1Size, int* nums2, int nums2Size) {\n    if (nums1Size \u003e nums2Size)\n        return findMedianSortedArrays(nums2, nums2Size, nums1, nums1Size);\n\n    int m = nums1Size, n = nums2Size;\n    int total = m + n;\n    int half = (total + 1) / 2;\n\n    int lo = 0, hi = m;\n    while (lo \u003c= hi) {\n        int i = (lo + hi) / 2;\n        int j = half - i;\n\n        int inLeft  = (i \u003e 0) ? nums1[i - 1] : NEG;\n        int inRight = (i \u003c m) ? nums1[i]     : INF;\n        int jnLeft  = (j \u003e 0) ? nums2[j - 1] : NEG;\n        int jnRight = (j \u003c n) ? nums2[j]     : INF;\n\n        if (inLeft \u003c= jnRight \u0026\u0026 jnLeft \u003c= inRight) {\n            if (total % 2 == 1)\n                return inLeft \u003e jnLeft ? inLeft : jnLeft;\n            int leftMax  = inLeft \u003e jnLeft ? inLeft : jnLeft;\n            int rightMin = inRight \u003c jnRight ? inRight : jnRight;\n            return (leftMax + rightMin) / 2.0;\n        } else if (inLeft \u003e jnRight) {\n            hi = i - 1;\n        } else {\n            lo = i + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return 0.0;\n}\n\n/* ==================== 测试 ==================== */\nint main(void) {\n    int a1[] = {1, 3},          b1[] = {2};\n    printf(\"%.5f  期望 2.00000\\n\", findMedianSortedArrays(a1, 2, b1, 1));\n\n    int a2[] = {1, 2},          b2[] = {3, 4};\n    printf(\"%.5f  期望 2.50000\\n\", findMedianSortedArrays(a2, 2, b2, 2));\n\n    int a3[] = {0, 0},          b3[] = {0, 0};\n    printf(\"%.5f  期望 0.00000\\n\", findMedianSortedArrays(a3, 2, b3, 2));\n\n    int a4[] = {2};             /* 另一边是空数组：测 m / n 为 0 的边界 */\n    printf(\"%.5f  期望 2.00000\\n\", findMedianSortedArrays(a4, 1, NULL, 0));\n\n    int b5[] = {1};\n    printf(\"%.5f  期望 1.00000\\n\", findMedianSortedArrays(NULL, 0, b5, 1));\n\n    int a6[] = {1, 3, 5, 7},    b6[] = {2, 4, 6, 8};\n    printf(\"%.5f  期望 4.50000\\n\", findMedianSortedArrays(a6, 4, b6, 4));\n\n    int a7[] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}, b7[] = {6, 7, 8, 9};\n    printf(\"%.5f  期望 5.00000\\n\", findMedianSortedArrays(a7, 5, b7, 4));\n\n    int a8[] = {1},             b8[] = {2, 3, 4, 5, 6};\n    printf(\"%.5f  期望 3.50000\\n\", findMedianSortedArrays(a8, 1, b8, 5));\n\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-je90bwa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-je90bwa","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"踩坑与收获"}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-fcignr3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-fcignr3","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-2dym9h4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-2dym9h4","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-n50utk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-n50utk0","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这题最大的收获：「中位数」可以换个说法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。以前我理解的求中位数就是「排好序取中间」，AI 告诉我还能理解成「找到一个划分，让左边个数固定、左边最大 ≤ 右边最小」——把「取值」问题变成「找位置」问题，这才有了二分的份。原来是这样！"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-1j698mo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-1j698mo","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-r760464","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-r760464","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"/ 2.0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"和"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"/ 2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"的区别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：这题返回 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"double"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，偶数个时中间两个求平均必须写 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"2.0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，不然整数除法把 2.5 直接截成 2.0。这个坑我以前在 PAT 里栽过，这次一眼就看出来了，有进步。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-941iptz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-941iptz","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-e8vu8an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-e8vu8an","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"短路求值的顺序"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：解法二里 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"i \u0026lt; nums1Size \u0026amp;\u0026amp; (j \u0026gt;= nums2Size || nums1[i] \u0026lt;= nums2[j])"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，越界判断一定写在读取 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums1[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 前面。以前写双指针老把条件写反，然后喜提 RE。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-eou422l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-eou422l","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-1jxhwk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-1jxhwk1","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"±∞ 哨兵"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：四个边界全用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"±(1\u0026lt;\u0026lt;30)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 顶掉，代码短了一截，也不会漏掉「某个数组为空」「i 切到 0 或 m」这些情况。一开始我用的是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"INT_MIN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，得 include ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"limits.h"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，还老担心 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-2147483648"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 这种字面量的坑；现在干脆拿一个偏大的数当无穷，反正元素最大只有 1e6。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-2t4qhcn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-2t4qhcn","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-4i6qcmc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-4i6qcmc","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"j = half - i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"会不会越界？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——这里就体现出「先保证 nums1 是短数组」的重要性了：因为 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"m \u0026lt;= n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，所以 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"half = (m+n+1)/2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 一定满足 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"half - m \u0026gt;= 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 且 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"half \u0026lt;= n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，于是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0 \u0026lt;= j \u0026lt;= n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 恒成立。要是没交换、让长数组去二分，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"j"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就可能变成负数或者超过 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，越界读马上就来了。这个推理是我自己顺出来的，写出来特别爽。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-05x4e06","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-05x4e06","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-9o7tq67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-9o7tq67","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"递归把自己当成 swap 用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：C 里没有现成的 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"swap"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，交换「地址 + 长度」四个东西最省事的就是递归调用自己一次。有点 hack，但比手写中间变量干净。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916173906-pvbudeg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-pvbudeg","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916173906-9acx69n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916173906-9acx69n","updated":"20260916173906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三种解法对比下来：解法一最直白但多开数组、复杂度不达标；解法二空间压到 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 但时间还是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"O(m+n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​；解法三是正解，思路一通代码不到 20 行。从「合并」到「划分」，这题是真学到东西了，我牛大了。"}]}]}]}]}